#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:4
msgid "<a0>Business Processes</a0> - Depiction of business processes as visual workflows as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>业务流程</a0> - 以可视化工作流形式描绘 L2 中提出的业务流程"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:1
msgid "<a0>Concepts</a0> - A glossary of terms and key concepts introduced in the L2 or in the Implementation Guide"
msgstr "<a0>概念</a0> - L2 或实施指南中提出的术语和关键概念词汇表"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:5
msgid "<a0>Data Dictionary</a0> - Data dictionary with detailed data specifications as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>数据字典</a0> - 包含 L2 中提出的详细数据规范的数据字典"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:6
msgid "<a0>Decision-support Logic</a0> - Decision-support logic and algorithms as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>决策支持逻辑</a0> - L2 中提出的决策支持逻辑和算法"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:8
msgid "<a0>Functional Requirements</a0> - List of core functions and capabilities the system must have to meet the end-users’ needs and achieve tasks within the business process."
msgstr "<a0>功能性需求</a0> - 系统为满足最终用户需求并完成业务流程中的任务所必须具备的核心功能和能力列表。"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:2
msgid "<a0>Generic Personas</a0> - Depiction of end-users and related stakeholders as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>通用人物画像</a0> - 描绘 L2 中提出的最终用户及相关利益相关方"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:7
msgid "<a0>Indicator and Performance Metrics</a0> - Core set of indicators and performance metrics as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>指标与绩效衡量</a0> - L2 中提出的核心指标和绩效衡量集"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:9
msgid "<a0>Non-functional Requirements</a0> - List of capabilities the system must have as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>非功能性需求</a0> - L2 中提出的系统必须具备的能力列表"

#: input/pagecontent/business-requirements.md:3
msgid "<a0>Use Cases</a0> - User scenarios depicting how different personas will interact in a typical workflow along with use cases listed as introduced in the L2"
msgstr "<a0>用例</a0> - 描绘不同人物画像在典型工作流中如何交互的用户场景，以及 L2 中列出的用例"
